---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Manifesto & Articles of Governance — MCR Lunch Club">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 sm:py-12 w-full space-y-8 font-serif-header">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="text-xs">
      <a href="/" class="text-[#8b1e22] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 font-bold">
        <span>←</span>
        <span>Return to Sovereign Map</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Pompous Header Card -->
    <div class="bg-[#1a1e24] text-[#f9f7f1] p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#c59b27] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-4xl">📜</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#c59b27] font-bold font-mono">
              The Constitutional Code
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#f9f7f1]">
              The Manifesto of the MCR Lunch Club
            </h1>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-300 italic pt-1 border-t border-[#c59b27]/30 max-w-3xl">
          “Adopted by solemn acclamation at Crown Square, Spinningfields. Wherein are set forth the eternal standards of sustenance, the sovereign powers of the Chairs, and the mathematical boundaries of lunchtime dignity.”
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-12 text-9xl text-white/5 pointer-events-none select-none">
        ⚖️
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Articles -->
    <div class="space-y-6 font-sans">
      <!-- Article I -->
      <section class="bg-[#fdfcf9] rounded-2xl border border-[#dcd6c8] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#dcd6c8] pb-2 font-serif-header">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#8b1e22]">
            Article I: The Sovereign Authority of the Chairs
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Art. 1.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          1.1 The governance of lunchtime within Central Manchester is vested wholly and indivisibly in the Chairs. Their authority is impartial, absolute, and not subject to plebiscite, office polling, or Slack message sentiment analysis.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          1.2 <strong>No Member Voting:</strong> In accordance with the doctrine of culinary purity, democratic voting is strictly forbidden. History proves that democracy at 12:25 invariably descends into an uninspired compromise at Pret A Manger.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          1.3 Members may suggest candidates for entry into <em>To Be Assessed</em>, but the verdict of admission belongs exclusively to the tribunal.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Article II -->
      <section class="bg-[#fdfcf9] rounded-2xl border border-[#dcd6c8] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#dcd6c8] pb-2 font-serif-header">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#8b1e22]">
            Article II: The Sacred Two-Visit Rule & Ejection Protocol
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Art. 2.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          2.1 <strong>The Dual Satisfactory Benchmark:</strong> No establishment shall attain the coveted status of <em>Approved</em> upon a solitary outing. Two separate, chronologically distinct visits conducted under full operational duress (12:15 to 13:00) must receive a formal verdict of <em>Satisfactory</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          2.2 <strong>The Guillotine Clause:</strong> Conversely, while excellence requires patient replication, mediocrity is rewarded swiftly. A single <em>Sub-par</em> audit by an official quorum shall precipitate summary ejection into <em>Rejected</em> or <em>If We Must</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          2.3 Re-evaluation of a condemned venue may not occur until six calendar months have elapsed and a written petition of contrition is filed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Article III -->
      <section class="bg-[#fdfcf9] rounded-2xl border border-[#dcd6c8] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#dcd6c8] pb-2 font-serif-header">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#8b1e22]">
            Article III: The 2.5-Mile Boundary & Walking Isochrones
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Art. 3.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          3.1 <strong>The Spinningfields Datum:</strong> The official origin of all geographical measurement is Crown Square / Hardman Square, Spinningfields (53.47985°N, 2.25105°W).
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          3.2 <strong>The 2.5-Mile Frontier:</strong> No establishment located beyond 2.5 miles from Base shall be admitted to the official ledger, save by extraordinary dispensation. Butty’s Booth (Old Trafford, 2.2 miles) and Rusholme Chippy (Wilmslow Road, 2.2 miles) demarcate the outermost perimeter of civilized jurisdiction.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          3.3 <strong>Temporal Supremacy:</strong> Decisions are governed by walking minutes, not statutory miles. Isochrones of 5, 10, 15, 20, and 25 minutes are etched upon the map to prevent catastrophic calendar overruns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Article IV -->
      <section class="bg-[#fdfcf9] rounded-2xl border border-[#dcd6c8] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#dcd6c8] pb-2 font-serif-header">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#8b1e22]">
            Article IV: The "Eat Like Us" Mandate
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Art. 4.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          4.1 Every Approved venue is endowed with an official recommended order known as <em>“Eat Like Us”</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          4.2 This order reflects the optimal balance of flavor, nutritional fortitude, and cost. While personal variation is permitted in private life, during official club sessions members are strongly encouraged to align their palates with the Chairs’ prescribed selection.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Article V -->
      <section class="bg-[#fdfcf9] rounded-2xl border border-[#dcd6c8] p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#dcd6c8] pb-2 font-serif-header">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#8b1e22]">
            Article V: Incorruptibility & The Hall of Shame
          </h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Art. 5.0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          5.1 Any benefit, hospitality, complimentary side portion, or preferential treatment proffered to influence a venue’s tier or rank shall be categorized as <em>Improper Benefit</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-serif-header">
          5.2 All such incidents shall be recorded in the <a href="/hall-of-shame" class="text-[#8b1e22] underline font-bold">Hall of Shame</a> with date, value, and names of offending parties. Confiscated tenders, soft drinks, or fries shall be examined and dispatched by the Chairs with solemn impartiality.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Sign-off seal -->
    <div class="text-center py-6 font-serif-header text-stone-600 text-xs space-y-1">
      <div class="text-xl">🔏</div>
      <div class="font-bold text-[#8b1e22] uppercase tracking-wider">
        Enacted by Order of The Chairs
      </div>
      <div class="italic">
        Chair Fletcher &bull; Vice-Chair Sterling &bull; Comptroller Davies
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
